{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>who came</b>, Jeshua — he is Joshua the high priest." "<b>Mordecai Bilshan</b> — he is Mordecai the Jew. Only Bilshan may perhaps be another man, and it is deficient [of a] vav, like the name Enosh." "<b>the number</b> — the second [occurrence] in the verse is a noun of reckoning, and the first is a personal name."], :book :ezra, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ezra -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:41:31.841494816Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}